# Start a new commander from the title screen and capture the docked status
# screen. The default selection on the title screen is "Start New Commander";
# Return opens the scenario screen, and Return there starts the first scenario
# (oolite-standard), which docks the player at the main station.
# Keys are sent as separate presses with pauses: Oolite debounces selection.
window 120
sleep 10
shot title
key Return
sleep 3
shot scenarios
key Return
sleep 10
shot docked
